x^{2} + \\sin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right) \\left(e^{x} - 3 \\sin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)}{\\left(e^{x} + 3 \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)^{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186488424} :answer-field/id #uuid "3f5ddf5f-58c3-5c2d-8e07-785497f48e6d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186488425}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "26d2dda4-3244-5741-b97a-7622e9d53637" :question/problem "If $f(x)=\\frac{x^{2} + \\sin{\\left(x \\right)}}{e^{x} + 3 \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}}$, find $f^{\\prime}(x)$ wherever the denominator is nonzero." :question/worked-solution "In this case, the expression for $f(x)$ is a quotient $\\frac{u(x)}{v(x)}$ with $u(x)=x^{2} + \\sin{\\left(x \\right)}$ and $v(x)=e^{x} + 3 \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}.$\n\nTherefore, we apply the quotient rule as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f^{\\prime}(x)&=\\frac{u^{\\prime}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot v^{\\prime}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}}\\\\ &=\\frac{(x^{2} + \\sin{\\left(x \\right)})^{\\prime}\\cdot (e^{x} + 3 \\cos{\\left(x \\right)})-(x^{2} + \\sin{\\left(x \\right)})\\cdot (e^{x} + 3 \\cos{\\left(x \\right)})^{\\prime}}{(e^{x} + 3 \\cos{\\left(x \\right)})^{2}}\\\\ &=\\frac{(2 x + \\cos{\\left(x \\right)})\\cdot (e^{x} + 3 \\cos{\\left(x \\right)})-(x^{2} + \\sin{\\left(x \\right)})\\cdot (e^{x} - 3 \\sin{\\left(x \\right)})}{(e^{x} + 3 \\cos{\\left(x \\right)})^{2}}\\\\ &=\\frac{3 x^{2} \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} + 6 x \\cos{\\left(x \\right)} + \\left(- x^{2} + 2 x - \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} + \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}\\right) e^{x} + 3}{\\left(e^{x} + 3 \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186488417 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1602b87e-13c5-5582-8276-c9c00ef5d533" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2 x + \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}}{e^{x} - \\sin{\\left(x \\right)}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186488410} {:ans